 damaged grain.\nAccording to FDA: “If the edible portion of a crop is exposed to flood waters, it is considered adulterated under section 402(a) (4) (21 U.S.C. 342(a) (4) of the Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act and should not enter human food channels. There is no practical method of reconditioning the edible portion of a crop that will provide a reasonable assurance of human food safety. Therefore, the FDA recommends that these crops be disposed of in a manner that ensures they are kept separate from crops that have not been flood damaged to avoid adulterating ‘clean’ crops.”\nIf you have any questions regarding flood damaged grain, please reach out to your POET grain merchandiser.\n"}, "highlighted": false}, {"id": 6513, "date": "2026-06-26", "title": "Trucking Available", "content": {"type": "text/plain", "value": "If you are needing any help getting corn hauled give us a call Poet-Shelbyville has trucking available.  "}, "highlighted": false}, {"id": 6850, "date": "2026-08-28", "title": "Hours and New texting service", "content": {"type": "text/plain", "value": "POET SHB: **Please note that we will be switching to a new texting service. According to FTC regulations please reply YES to the text that comes out."}, "highlighted": false}, {"id": 6908, "date": "2026-09-04", "title": "Hours", "content": {"type": "text/plain", "value": "POET SHB: Monday Closed, Tues 7:30a-2p, Weds 10a-2p."}, "highlighted": true}], "delivery_info": {"notice": {"type": "text/plain", "value": "\nDakota Gold (DDG) Loading- Hours  7:30am till 3:30pm EST - Monday through Friday- - - - Feed Inquiries Call: 888-327-8799 - - - Wet Cake (Wet DDG) Loading- 7 days a week, 24 hours a day\n\n\n"}, "scale_hours": {"hours": [{"date": "2026-09-07", "closed": true, "hours_state": "closed"}, {"end": "14:00", "date": "2026-09-08", "start": "07:30"}, {"end": "14:00", "date": "2026-09-09", "start": "10:00"}, {"end": "14:00", "date": "2026-09-10", "start": "07:30"}, {"end": "14:00", "date": "2026-09-11"